":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2178779105"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108044#discussion_r2178779105"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108044"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2178779105/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":1212,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2173830979,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2178779821","pull_request_review_id":2977302765,"id":2178779821,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6B3Yqt","diff_hunk":"@@ -1209,6 +1209,18 @@ void RenderForwardMobile::_render_scene(RenderDataRD *p_render_data, const Color\n \n \t\tRD::get_singleton()->draw_command_end_label(); //Render Opaque\n \n+\t\tif (scene_state.used_opaque_stencil) {","path":"servers/rendering/renderer_rd/forward_mobile/render_forward_mobile.cpp","commit_id":"62a5cd90a7804ce063d30514c3753b7934f1ffec","original_commit_id":"fb3fd904ad3f65601d0efc52ad235dcc4d3116c3","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I really don't think we should be drawing stencil objects twice. Depth + color + stencil writes should all happen at once during the opaque pass. Then objects with a stencil read should happen in the alpha pass. It should be that simple. ","created_at":"2025-07-02T00:53:02Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T00:53:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108044#discussion_r2178779821","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108044","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2178779821"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108044#discussion_r2178779821"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108044"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2178779821/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":1212,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2173830979,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2178841709","pull_request_review_id":2977386516,"id":2178841709,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6B3nxt","diff_hunk":"@@ -1209,6 +1209,18 @@ void RenderForwardMobile::_render_scene(RenderDataRD *p_render_data, const Color\n \n \t\tRD::get_singleton()->draw_command_end_label(); //Render Opaque\n \n+\t\tif (scene_state.used_opaque_stencil) {","path":"servers/rendering/renderer_rd/forward_mobile/render_forward_mobile.cpp","commit_id":"62a5cd90a7804ce063d30514c3753b7934f1ffec","original_commit_id":"fb3fd904ad3f65601d0efc52ad235dcc4d3116c3","user":{"login":"apples","id":2352020,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTIwMjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2352020?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apples","html_url":"https://github.com/apples","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apples/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apples/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apples/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apples/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apples/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apples/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apples/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apples/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apples/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"@clayjohn Sorry the description was slightly outdated, the stencil buffer is *not* cleared anymore with this current PR. I've updated the description to be more accurate. This PR introduces a separate pipeline for the first draw of stencil materials which disables stencil writes, so no clear is necessary.\r\n\r\nThe screenshot in the linked issue shows what happens when stencil writes occur at the same time as depth writes, and I don't think it's possible to resolve this without doing a second draw.\r\nWithout complete depth information, \"depth pass\" stencil writes might occur and write incorrect stencil values, before another mesh is drawn which occludes the stencil object.\r\n\r\nIt's the same reason we force depth pre-pass on when using stencil in forward+.\r\n\r\nIf you're interested, I can share RenderDoc captures of both scenarios.","created_at":"2025-07-02T02:07:53Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T02:07:53Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108044#discussion_r2178841709","pull_request_url":"https://api.githu