ij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I haven't dived into this deep enough so I could very much be barking up the wrong tree here.\r\n\r\nIt looks like all objects are passed a second time, wouldn't only the objects that require stencil checks need to be in this stencil pass? It wouldn't be too hard to create a `RENDER_LIST_STENCIL` that has only the objects that need to be rendered a second time, or maybe even only render the stencil objects here and remove them from RENDER_LIST_OPAQUE all together, and then apply a sort algorithm there similar to how we do with transparent object?","created_at":"2025-07-02T06:45:56Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T06:45:56Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108044#discussion_r2179253736","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108044","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2179253736"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108044#discussion_r2179253736"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108044"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2179253736/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":1212,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2173830979,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2179471091","pull_request_review_id":2978265887,"id":217